678 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 219 0 R
/E (What is to be done. Design and build a local software system that, given an imperfect fragment of memory, returns the intended document from a personal library of text, PDF and image files, ranks it high, explains why it matched and suggests related documents. How it is to be done. By scanning folders, extracting text \(using OCR where needed\), storing it in a database, building an in-memory positional inverted index, retrieving candidates through exact, prefix, infix, typo-tolerant and phrase routes, ranking them with BM25 and explicit boosts, and linking documents through a concept graph. A web interface and a command-line interface expose the engine.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
