798 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (Selection and reason. Design B scores highest and was selected. It is the only design that meets the typo-tolerance, explainability and offline objectives together, it keeps SQLite as a reliable source of truth, and it lets the optional semantic layer from Design C be added without making a language model mandatory. Its disadvantage, building the index in memory for each search session, was accepted because the measured cost is small \(Section 4.1.4\).)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
