<<
/Title (The system was built module by module, bottom-up: document model, ingestion, extraction, storage, index, retrieval, ranking, graph, command-line interface, and finally the Python adapter and browser interface. Each module has a public header under include/afterimage/<module>/ and a unit-test file, so it could be tested before the next module depended on it. Derived data \(the index and graph\) is never stored; it is rebuilt from SQLite, so it cannot disagree with the stored text.)
