/Title (A Document holds id, title, file path, file type, extracted text, size and modification time. DocumentManager stores documents in a vector and keeps an unordered_map from ID to position for O\(1\) lookup. IDs come from a counter; when the library is reloaded from SQLite, restoreDocument keeps the saved ID and moves the counter past it, so IDs are stable across restarts and are never reused. Insertion is exception-safe: the lookup entry is rolled back if the vector insertion throws.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
