/Title (skip_permission_denied. Symbolic links are counted and skipped, hidden entries \(names starting with a dot\) are skipped and hidden folders are not entered. Only the extensions txt, md, markdown, pdf, png, jpg, jpeg, tif, tiff, bmp, webp and gif are kept. Every problem becomes a ScanIssue in the report instead of stopping the scan. The IngestionService normalises each path with weakly_canonical so one file reached by two routes is one document, and classifies every file as new, already known, changed \(size or modification)
