3674 0 obj
<<
/Title (External tools run through a small runProcess function built on posix_spawn with a pipe for output. It never builds a shell command, so a file name containing spaces or shell characters cannot inject commands. It reads the pipe without blocking, caps the output size and kills the child with SIGKILL on timeout. Every outcome is an ExtractionStatus \(Success, Partial, Empty, Unsupported, DependencyMissing, Failed or TooLarge\). ExtractionService wraps each file in try/catch so one bad file never aborts a run. TextNormaliser removes the byte-order mark, unifies line endings and trims trailing blanks.)
/Dest [31 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3660 0 R
/Prev 3673 0 R
>>
endobj
