<<
/Title (To add a document the index \(1\) removes any old postings for the same ID so re-indexing never duplicates, \(2\) tokenises, \(3\) groups positions by term, \(4\) appends one Posting per term, and \(5\) records the document length and updates the running total used for the average length. Adding costs O\(n + u log V\) for n tokens, u unique terms and vocabulary size V. A std::map is used instead of an unordered_map because sorted terms make prefix search possible without scanning; looking up one term costs O\(log V\).)
/Dest [32 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3698 0 R
/Prev 3724 0 R
>>
